OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Tuesday with outbreaks of rain,
OL,7,Fperhaps heavy. Likely turning drier on
OL,8,FWednesday before further showers on
OL,9,FThursday. Temperatures gradually
OL,10,Freturning to average.
